---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Docs · Tracelane" description="Full documentation is in progress. The source and README are on GitHub today.">
  <section class="container-prose py-24">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-fg-dim mb-4 tracking-wider lowercase">docs</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg">Docs are in progress.</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
      Full docs are being written and will land at
      <code class="font-mono text-fg">docs.tracelane.dev</code>. In the meantime the source and README live on
      <a href="https://github.com/tracelane" class="underline decoration-fg-subtle hover:decoration-fg transition-colors" rel="noopener">github.com/tracelane</a>.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-16 space-y-8">
      <article>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs text-pop lowercase tracking-wider">what the docs will cover</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-fg-muted">
          <li>— Gateway: install, configure 30+ LLM providers, traffic shaping, failover</li>
          <li>— Tracing: OTel GenAI semantics, SDK quickstarts, replay workflow</li>
          <li>— Audit ledger: SHA-256 hash chain + Ed25519-signed Merkle root, offline verify</li>
          <li>— Pre-flight policy: schema-violation + tool-definition-drift checks at the gateway</li>
          <li>— CLI: <code class="font-mono text-fg">tlane verify</code> (audit-chain verification); <code class="font-mono text-fg">tlane import-helicone</code> and <code class="font-mono text-fg">tlane import-litellm</code> </li>
          <li>— Self-host: Docker Compose for dev, Helm chart for prod, single-node Hetzner reference</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-16 text-sm text-fg-subtle">
      Get product updates —
      <a href="/#notify" class="underline decoration-fg-subtle hover:decoration-fg">notify list</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
